# TEST PRICING (development only): one switch for all temporary test prices.
#   on    -> every published product gets a clearly labelled TEST PRICE (never an MRP, never in SEO data)
#   off   -> no product has a price; the cart cannot be filled; any test-priced cart lines are discarded
#   unset -> ON in `npm run dev`, OFF in production builds (`npm run build` / `npm start`)
# Copy this file to .env.local to override.
NEXT_PUBLIC_TEST_PRICES=on

# Public site URL used for canonical links, Open Graph and structured data.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.example.com
